  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童插珠帐篷拼搭积木玩具",
    "en": "Kids Fort Building Block Toy Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "该产品为儿童拼搭类益智玩具，采用PP材质，适用于家庭亲子互动、课堂活动与培训场景。产品以拆装房子主题为核心，强调动手实践与空间构建体验。\n\n基础信息：品牌为尧顺，产地为东莞茶山，杆子长度约40cm。该款归类为14岁以上玩具，支持彩盒颜色定制。",
    "en": "This product is a children-focused construction toy made of PP material, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and training scenarios. It centers on detachable house-style fort building and hands-on spatial play.\n\nBasic information: Brand Yaoshun, origin Chashan (Dongguan), rod length about 40 cm. The product is categorized as a 14+ toy and supports color-box customization."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该产品面向儿童创意拼搭与互动训练场景，适用于家庭、学校和课程化教学活动。产品采用PP材质，结构以插珠+杆件组合方式实现拆装房子、帐篷等多种拼搭形式。",
      "产品定位为14岁以上玩具，适合用于动手实践、空间认知和亲子协作类场景。围绕搭建过程可形成连续的互动玩法，便于在教学和活动环境中反复使用。",
      "包装信息包含彩盒、规格号、长宽高、体积和重量等关键项，便于渠道上架与仓配管理。支持彩盒颜色定制，可按项目需求进行长期供货协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This product is designed for children’s creative construction and interactive learning scenarios, including family use, school activities, and structured educational programs. It uses PP material and a bead-plus-rod structure to support detachable house and fort-style builds.",
      "Positioned as a 14+ toy, it is suitable for hands-on practice, spatial cognition, and parent-child collaboration settings. The build process supports repeatable interactive play for classroom and activity use.",
      "Packaging information includes color box type, specification code, dimensions, volume, and weight, which supports channel listing and warehouse operations. Color-box customization is available, and long-term project supply collaboration is supported."
    ]
  },
